<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were mixed at the</p>
<p>Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The three-month rate</p>
<p>was unchanged at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>			     May 2 fix	  April 30 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	    3.04 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	    3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	    3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	    3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	    3.31 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	   3.42 pct		3.44 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
